      'safety-critical use. Integrators retain the responsibilities stated in the\n' +
      'product charter.\n' +
      '\n' +
      'Every behavior-changing slice must add or cite a governing row and preserve\n' +
      'both directions of traceability. Higher-hazard or broader-reach work must also\n' +
      'record misuse and boundary analysis, rollback, applicable `HZ-*` controls,\n' +
      'focused and broader verification, retained results, and release-evidence\n' +
      'disposition. Unknown relationships remain explicit gaps rather than inferred\n' +
